📅 Modern Java Swing Calendar


English

💜 About the Project

This is an advanced and highly customizable calendar component developed in Java Swing. The standout feature of this project is its Dynamic Layout system, which allows switching between different views (Date, Month, and Year) with smooth transitions and a modern interface inspired by neumorphic design.

🚀 Features

•
Adaptive Layout: Dynamic switching between day, month, and year views.

•
Modern Design: Rounded corners, soft shadows, and clean typography.

•
Fluid Navigation: Interactive header for quick period switching.

•
Flexible Architecture: Model classes (ModelDate, ModelMonth) separated from visual logic.

•
Easy Integration: Ready to be used as a component in Dashboards or scheduling systems.

🛠️ Technologies

•
Language: Java

•
Interface: Java Swing & AWT

•
Styling: Graphics2D for custom rendering.




